-- src:403 | 12 months or to both.
@ref SSSA2015 s 8(6) (src:400-403)
GIVETH A Penalty
`s 8(6) the greatest penalty` MEANS Penalty OF 5000, 12

-- src:400 | (6) Any person who does any act in contravention of subsection (3)
-- src:401 | shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine
-- src:402 | not exceeding $5,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding
-- src:403 | 12 months or to both.
@ref SSSA2015 s 8(6) (src:400-403)
